{{!
    @template mod_syllabus/plan_final_assessment

    The "Avaliação Final" block the 3 source documents show as its own section, separate from
    the week-by-week list — extracted here from whichever activity/activities carry
    isfinalassessment, via plan_read_export::final_assessment_activities(). Reuses
    plan_activity_read.mustache as-is (including its own red badge) so this section and the
    activity's own place inside its week never drift out of sync on a field change; the
    activity is intentionally shown in both places, matching how the Cronograma table already
    duplicates the same data. Shared by the 3 read-only tabs (student, tutor, Tab 1's
    read-only branch) — never rendered in the edit-mode branch, where the isfinalassessment
    checkbox on the activity itself is already the single source of truth.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasfinalassessments": true,
        "finalassessments": [
            {
                "title": "Prova Final",
                "type": "quiz",
                "category": "online",
                "startdate": 1749000000,
                "enddate": 1749600000,
                "points": 40,
                "isfinalassessment": true,
                "weektitle": "Semana 8",
                "studentinstructions": "<p>Prova cobrindo todo o conteúdo do semestre.</p>",
                "showtutorfields": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#hasfinalassessments}}
<h3>{{#str}} finalassessment, mod_syllabus {{/str}}</h3>
<div class="syllabus-final-assessment-list mb-3">
    {{#finalassessments}}
        {{> mod_syllabus/plan_activity_read }}
    {{/finalassessments}}
</div>
{{/hasfinalassessments}}
